          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 39,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "I will turn you around, will lead you on, and will cause you to come up from the uttermost parts of the north; and I will bring you onto the mountains of Israel.",
      "ko": "너를 돌이켜서 이끌고 먼 북방에서부터 나와서 이스라엘 산 위에 이르러",
      "source_text_hash": "2d5deed0f0b52cfe0d6779413bb0f8eab8c1300d5177fb9fcd5670e64ff7c613",
      "translation_text_hash": "ceb19c1db1b933ffd4747c7d53c225f7149dcb71b53f63ea7c905d517b59449b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
