      ],
      "en": "I will strike your bow out of your left hand, and will cause your arrows to fall out of your right hand.",
      "ko": "네 활을 쳐서 네 왼손에서 떨어뜨리고 네 살을 네 오른손에서 떨어뜨리리니",
      "source_text_hash": "e424b68f4253bd5d206b7ff3768faef9e667c6261cef85afebaefb51afd82629",
      "translation_text_hash": "d53c1552f0a3b84685836d8233928ef839711dd97288a6fa47fe40f376f254f0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "네 활을 쳐서 네 왼손에서 떨어뜨리고 네 살을 네 오른손에서 떨어뜨리리니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d53c1552f0a3b84685836d8233928ef839711dd97288a6fa47fe40f376f254f0"
      ]
