      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EZK",
          "chapter": 39,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "So the house of Israel will know that I am the LORD their God, from that day and forward.",
      "ko": "그 날 이후에 이스라엘 족속은 나를 여호와 자기들의 하나님인줄 알겠고",
      "source_text_hash": "acb0028b20678070f709974694dc5fb35b3b3e2ad43fb46c7c7bc7e7d0917f17",
      "translation_text_hash": "dcbacddb7008353c20129a5ff6795f094c397d64720c0a5ecb33ffb5d59d3356",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그 날 이후에 이스라엘 족속은 나를 여호와 자기들의 하나님인줄 알겠고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "dcbacddb7008353c20129a5ff6795f094c397d64720c0a5ecb33ffb5d59d3356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EZK:39:23",
      "sequence": 21472,
      "chapter_label": "EZK 39",
      "verse_label": "23",
